  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National Rainwater Drainage in Bolivia</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa Nacional de Drenaje Pluvial en Bolivia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Contribuir a mejorar la calidad de vida de la poblaci&#xf3;n que habita en &#xe1;reas urbanas de Bolivia mediante inversiones para el acceso y mejora de los servicios de agua potable, saneamiento y gesti&#xf3;n de residuos s&#xf3;lidos, bajo un enfoque de cambio clim&#xe1;tico, resiliencia y econom&#xed;a circular.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribute to the reduction of the negative impacts caused by extreme hydrometeorological events in urban areas of Bolivia, through the protection of the population from the risks of floods and geodynamic events (improvement of rain drainage systems and awareness of the population on waste management), the reduction of the economic costs associated with such events, and the strengthening of the prevention and monitoring systems of the municipalities in an environment of climate uncertainty.</narrative>
  </description>
